    "body": "Thank you for filing this issue.\n\nSince the appcache feature is deprecated and some browser vendors are actively trying to remove support, I don't think there is much interest in tweaking the spec text. If possible use service workers instead.\n\nAs for the questions you asked, I suspect it is non-ambiguous if you follow the processing model algorithms. The text you quoted are just non-normative statements; in principle they could be removed altogether without changing what the spec requires. Hope that helps!\n",
